## Summary

Supports #54.

Add a self-contained visual prototype for the proposed Usage Explorer roadmap.

The artifact preserves the dashboard's compact dark visual system while demonstrating:

- one canonical range/tool/model/project/search scope;
- visible removable filter state;
- decision-guided period summary and pricing coverage;
- chart-to-filter drilldown;
- scoped model and session tables;
- server-pagination direction;
- metadata-first session detail;
- explicit conceptual versus expected behavior boundaries.

## Visual prototype

- [Open the self-contained HTML prototype](https://github.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer.html)
- [Desktop capture](https://github.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer-desktop.png)
- [Mobile capture](https://github.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer-mobile.png)

![Usage Explorer desktop prototype](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer-desktop.png)

## Prototype status

Conceptual:

- exact visual spacing;
- sample values;
- final API and endpoint shapes;
- production chart implementation.

Expected behavior for later implementation issues:

- one canonical filter scope across overview, chart, model breakdown, and history;
- URL-persisted filter state;
- chart-to-row drilldown;
- paginated usage history;
- privacy-safe, metadata-first session detail;
- unavailable source fields remain unavailable rather than zero.

## Verification

- `REVIEW_MODE=docs scripts/review.sh`
- `git diff --check`
- extracted inline JavaScript passes `node --check`
- Playwright desktop smoke at 1440x1000
- Playwright mobile smoke at 390x844
- no document-level horizontal overflow at either width
- no browser console or page errors
- quick range, filter apply/remove, chart table fallback, chart drilldown, session drawer, Escape close, and focus return exercised

This PR adds a design artifact only. It does not change dashboard production behavior.
